---
// Fixture page for the v2 visual QA of the slide links and the viewer. Not in the nav.
import SlideLink from '../../components/slides/SlideLink.astro';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { href } from '../../lib/url';
---

<Base title="Dev: slides">
  <h1>Dev: slides</h1>
  <p>
    A slide citation sits inside a sentence. The Session 1 deck starts on <SlideLink session={1} page={1} />, and the
    framing lesson cites <SlideLink session={1} page={39} />. The last page of the Session 5 deck is <SlideLink
      session={5}
      page={51}
    />.
  </p>
  <p>
    A plain click opens the viewer. A click with Ctrl or Cmd opens the PDF in a new tab. With no JavaScript, the link
    opens the PDF at its page.
  </p>
  <h2>A link that looks like a button</h2>
  <p><SlideLink session={3} page={1} class="btn">View the Session 3 slides</SlideLink></p>
  <p><a href={href('slides/')}>The slides page</a> · <a href={href('about/')}>About</a></p>
</Base>
